WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.223 --> 00:00:14.904
Nina said.

2
00:00:14.924 --> 00:00:17.725
"Can you sleep over on Saturday?"

3
00:00:18.706 --> 00:00:19.567
Izzie smiled.

4
00:00:19.587 --> 00:00:21.628
"I'll ask my mom.

5
00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:23.409
I think so!"

6
00:00:24.729 --> 00:00:26.090
Nina bounced on her toes.

7
00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:28.712
"We'll have so much fun!"

8
00:00:30.004 --> 00:00:31.544
She looked at Bobby and Jason.

9
00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:34.365
"Sorry, boys.

10
00:00:35.446 --> 00:00:37.746
The sleepover is just for girls."

11
00:00:39.447 --> 00:00:40.707
Bobby rolled his eyes.

12
00:00:40.727 --> 00:00:44.568
"We don't want to go to a girls' sleepover."

13
00:00:44.588 --> 00:00:51.070
"Everyone—boys and girls—will like today's recipe," Chef said.

14
00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:53.630
"It's vanilla ice cream."

15
00:00:55.371 --> 00:00:56.691
Jason looked disappointed.

16
00:00:56.711 --> 00:00:59.112
"I don't really like ice cream."

17
00:01:00.136 --> 00:01:00.797
He shrugged.

18
00:01:00.817 --> 00:01:02.558
"I'll try it though."

19
00:01:02.578 --> 00:01:06.241
"The recipe is simple," Chef said.

20
00:01:06.261 --> 00:01:08.703
"But it takes a while to freeze.

21
00:01:09.684 --> 00:01:10.565
Let's get started."

22
00:01:13.087 --> 00:01:15.669
Nina poured a can of condensed milk into a bowl.

23
00:01:17.491 --> 00:01:19.012
Izzie added salt and vanilla.

24
00:01:21.854 --> 00:01:23.536
Bobby whisked everything together.

25
00:01:23.556 --> 00:01:28.320
"Now we have to whip two cups of heavy cream," Jason said.

26
00:01:32.884 --> 00:01:34.545
Izzie whipped the cream with the mixer.

27
00:01:34.565 --> 00:01:38.047
"I see peaks!"

28
00:01:38.527 --> 00:01:39.407
Bobby shouted.

29
00:01:40.288 --> 00:01:41.128
"It's ready!"

30
00:01:42.829 --> 00:01:43.589
Chef nodded.

31
00:01:43.609 --> 00:01:48.052
"Nina, please fold a cup of whipped cream into the milk mixture.

32
00:01:49.072 --> 00:01:52.674
Next, we'll fold that mixture into the rest of the whipped cream."

33
00:01:55.075 --> 00:01:56.696
The kids followed the instructions.

34
00:02:04.876 --> 00:02:06.937
Then Chef removed a pan from the freezer.

35
00:02:08.678 --> 00:02:09.999
"I chilled this loaf pan.

36
00:02:10.959 --> 00:02:13.381
We'll freeze our mixture in it for two hours.

37
00:02:14.361 --> 00:02:17.563
Before you go home, we'll stir in our final ingredient."

38
00:02:20.865 --> 00:02:24.307
While the mixture was freezing, the kids went outside to do chores.

39
00:02:28.069 --> 00:02:31.150
"You boys can pick vegetables," Nina said.

40
00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.772
"We'll feed the animals."

41
00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.890
"Hey!" Bobby frowned.

42
00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:40.272
"Don't boss us around!"

43
00:02:41.813 --> 00:02:43.074
Nina folded her arms.

44
00:02:43.094 --> 00:02:46.817
"Izzie and I want to talk about our sleepover.

45
00:02:46.837 --> 00:02:49.359
So leave us alone."

46
00:02:51.281 --> 00:02:53.963
Cinnamon barked as the kids shouted back and forth.

47
00:02:55.284 --> 00:02:56.365
Chef came to the door.

48
00:02:56.385 --> 00:03:03.964
"Chefs! Get busy—now!"

49
00:03:04.244 --> 00:03:06.105
Later Chef removed the pan from the freezer.

50
00:03:06.125 --> 00:03:10.366
"Great! Our ice cream is frozen.

51
00:03:11.466 --> 00:03:13.227
Now we'll stir something into it."

52
00:03:16.228 --> 00:03:17.548
Nina looked at the options.

53
00:03:19.108 --> 00:03:21.029
There was a bowl of crushed chocolate cookies.

54
00:03:22.269 --> 00:03:24.810
Other bowls had crushed peppermints and other candies.

55
00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:28.951
"I want peppermint," Bobby said.

56
00:03:28.971 --> 00:03:31.092
"Me too!"

57
00:03:31.272 --> 00:03:32.052
Jason said.

58
00:03:33.852 --> 00:03:36.173
"I want cookies," Nina said.

59
00:03:37.273 --> 00:03:37.973
Izzie nodded.

60
00:03:37.993 --> 00:03:45.035
"Cookies!" Bobby laughed and pointed to Chef.

61
00:03:45.055 --> 00:03:49.936
"There are more boys than girls.

62
00:03:51.017 --> 00:03:52.597
That means we get to choose.

63
00:03:52.917 --> 00:03:53.697
Right, Chef?"

64
00:03:55.598 --> 00:03:56.398
Chef sighed.

65
00:03:56.418 --> 00:03:59.839
"I don't think so, Bobby.

66
00:04:00.779 --> 00:04:03.560
Let's just add both ingredients to the ice cream."

67
00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:09.341
Jason swirled peppermints into the ice cream.

68
00:04:10.861 --> 00:04:12.181
Izzie swirled in cookies.

69
00:04:15.142 --> 00:04:16.983
Chef put the pan back in the freezer.

70
00:04:17.003 --> 00:04:22.064
"The ice cream needs three more hours to freeze.

71
00:04:23.285 --> 00:04:26.665
So we'll taste it tomorrow."

72
00:04:27.826 --> 00:04:30.006
The next day Izzie ran into class.

73
00:04:30.026 --> 00:04:34.348
"Nina! Mom said I can sleep over!"

74
00:04:36.384 --> 00:04:38.765
Bobby yawned.

75
00:04:38.785 --> 00:04:41.106
"So boring.

76
00:04:42.047 --> 00:04:44.027
They think sleeping is fun."

77
00:04:45.668 --> 00:04:46.628
Jason laughed.

78
00:04:47.969 --> 00:04:51.351
"Bobby's coming home with me today to play video games.

79
00:04:52.451 --> 00:04:53.772
At least we'll be awake!"

80
00:04:55.492 --> 00:04:57.393
Nina frowned but didn't say anything.

81
00:04:59.194 --> 00:05:00.875
Chef got the pan from the freezer.

82
00:05:00.895 --> 00:05:02.996
"Our ice cream is solid.

83
00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:03.856
It's ready."

84
00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.681
He scooped out five servings.

85
00:05:11.902 --> 00:05:13.043
Nina tasted hers.

86
00:05:13.063 --> 00:05:17.505
"Mmm!" Jason nodded.

87
00:05:17.525 --> 00:05:19.385
"It's good.

88
00:05:19.906 --> 00:05:23.147
And He looked shyly at Nina and Izzie.

89
00:05:23.167 --> 00:05:26.508
"The cookies are my favorite part."

90
00:05:28.109 --> 00:05:29.049
Nina smiled.

91
00:05:29.069 --> 00:05:32.150
"Have fun playing video games later."

92
00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:35.652
“Thanks,” Jason said.

93
00:05:36.712 --> 00:05:39.396
“Enjoy your sleepover,” Bobby said.

94
00:05:41.039 --> 00:05:43.402
Nina licked her spoon and nodded at Izzie.

95
00:05:43.422 --> 00:05:45.104
“We will!”
